{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45fe81751ba1547592204ef5aac029e92698000aecae25e79de04318734ab068",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b92b029320950dc2e86b8ba9c1469a77f54b919d21a1dc16ad97aaae6b03e756",
      "text": "（自从雨彦先生帮我掸掉脏污后，\n肩膀酸痛好像变轻松了……是心理作用吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa156fe3930da59b52c59b65fe96d80894608ff4ad2ab8790be8c151832e999f",
      "text": "哟，早上好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c680f625e784f87b76d613953acaeb892d552b4541e7a9504d21aedffb6bf089",
      "text": "雨彦先生，早上好。……咦？\n已经到Legenders碰头的时间了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75f46b325f941561e7e0b807a4d1e7b0344de79a34bcdb6c43e35757d14803c",
      "text": "不，离碰头还有一阵子呢。\n我只是突然想来打扫一下事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:708376e51492e0f01a5828fd8a2d473a56d1b4ed075bedbdf49d3cf787c7f8cb",
      "text": "只是稍微早到了点而已。\n借用一下那边的清扫用具啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5105347b66ef83d80aa955046cc40ae82130bad71e3545af5ce70193aee1336e",
      "text": "打扫由我和贤君来做就行了，\n雨彦先生不用挂心也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64d726b04dee1276eae3ca5753db19e70c9930f16b67afe73a42da07c41d848",
      "text": "“怎么能让偶像做打扫呢”，\n咱们事务所可不是那么装腔作势的地方吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09e768b1fd43ccf581074ff71d5f623e1fcc01c941094b2c508eb258be1eaeca",
      "text": "而且，偶尔也让我展现一下\n作为清扫屋的手艺还没生疏嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2dac55972c7157932a854cccbf5df5fa08a61190ef28205352f9ef20837ab1",
      "text": "呵呵，那么就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd9b35f84cd83a852cc974878e7fbe3ca3025658821356a5443cc68b1f23a867",
      "text": "谢啦。打扰你工作真不好意思啊。\n在开会之前，我会收拾得干干净净的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a830a1fc5dc1e81d4d36176ad493ab2dc383c552d4ad61eb569096f9a6131579",
      "text": "不，正好我手头的工作也告一段落了，\n我也来帮忙。一起把事务所打扫干净吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
